<PageTitle>Pagination — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Pagination</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Links, not buttons: a page is a URL, so it can be shared, opened in a tab and reached by the
    back button. A click handler gives you none of the three.
</p>

